        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. Leave for Academic Study—Upon written application, leave for academic study for a period not to exceed one (1) full school year may be granted by the Board of Education upon recommendation of the superintendent. An outline of a planned program must be submitted with the application for leave. In addition, the unit member shall furnish such reports of progress and/or completion of the approved program as are requested by the superintendent.",
