        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "c) Salary Allowance—Unit members granted academic leave shall receive one-half (½) their regular salary during the specific period of leave if they agree to return to MCPS for a two-year period immediately following the period of leave and sixty (60) percent of salary if they agree to return to MCPS for a period of three (3) years immediately following the period of leave. This salary shall be paid at the beginning of each semester.",
